{"id":"3743f726a3653802","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-constructible.md","title":"Constructible Universe","display":"df-constructible — Constructible Universe","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-constructible","aliases":["58-df-constructible","L","Constructible Universe"],"display":"df-constructible — Constructible Universe","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-definable]]","[[58-df-class]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-constructible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-constructible</span><span>L</span><span>Constructible Universe</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-constructible — Constructible Universe"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a63c990f1580982\" href=\"?note=9a63c990f1580982\" title=\"58-df-definable\">58-df-definable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,D,x\\in V\">\\(M,D,x\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> a class variable</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> (the first-order language of set theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S(X,\\langle M,\\in\\rangle,\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S(X,\\langle M,\\in\\rangle,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> (definable-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9a63c990f1580982\" href=\"?note=9a63c990f1580982\" title=\"58-df-definable\">58-df-definable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S(L)\\)</span> (definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"58-df-class\">58-df-class</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_\\in(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_\\in(M)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConstructibleUniverse}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConstructibleUniverse}_S(L)\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible} \\vdash L_0\\coloneqq \\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible} \\vdash L_0\\coloneqq \\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}definable\\text{-}power} \\vdash \\operatorname{Def}_\\in(M)\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq M:\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S(X,\\langle M,\\in\\rangle,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}definable\\text{-}power} \\vdash \\operatorname{Def}_\\in(M)\\coloneqq\\{X\\subseteq M:\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S(X,\\langle M,\\in\\rangle,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}successor\\text{-}stage} \\vdash \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(L_{\\beta+1}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Def}_\\in(L_\\beta)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}successor\\text{-}stage} \\vdash \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(L_{\\beta+1}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Def}_\\in(L_\\beta)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}limit\\text{-}stage} \\vdash \\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to L_\\lambda\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}L_\\beta\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}limit\\text{-}stage} \\vdash \\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to L_\\lambda\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}L_\\beta\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}universe} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConstructibleUniverse}_S(L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(L)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(x\\in L_\\alpha)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constructible\\text{-}universe} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConstructibleUniverse}_S(L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(L)\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\bigl(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(x\\in L_\\alpha)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is the least transitive inner-model class containing all ordinals; it need not be a set-sized model.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L \\subseteq V\">\\(L \\subseteq V\\)</span>: constructible sets form absolute hierarchy</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L \\models \\mathrm{GCH}\">\\(L \\models \\mathrm{GCH}\\)</span>: Generalize Continuum Hypothesis holds</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V = L\">\\(V = L\\)</span>: Axiom of Constructibility</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}) \\to \\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC} + V = L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC}) \\to \\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC} + V = L)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, Set Theory, Chapter 13</li>\n<li>Kunen, Set Theory, Chapter VIII</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-definable","status":"resolved","id":"9a63c990f1580982","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-definable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c91